Modifications
-------------
Mailaxe modifies the original Aerion source code. Every change made to the
Aerion files is recorded in the Git history of the Mailaxe repository
(https://github.com/valba8/mailaxe), starting after Aerion's v0.3.6-dev
branch. In summary, Mailaxe:

  - renames the application to Mailaxe and gives it its own data directory,
    keyring entries and single-instance lock, so it can run alongside Aerion;
  - ships without OAuth client credentials (users provide their own);
  - adds optional message viewer and message list features (collapsible
    quoted text, checkbox toolbar toggle, account color strip, unread accent
    under the avatar, hover quick actions, View Source in the context menu)
    and fixes "Collapse all".

